{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884550/extras/46a7da02665a160a4713598eb68ae409.poster.avif?t=1756147854\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884550/extras/46a7da02665a160a4713598eb68ae409.webm?t=1756147854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884550/extras/46a7da02665a160a4713598eb68ae409.mp4?t=1756147854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884550/extras/70086864b61f555faa106e0e0f6b799b.avif?t=1756147854\" width=800 height=120 /></span>This is Resonating Cords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  The tale of a world ruled by the god made flesh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tale of the saint who was chosen as replace.<br><br>In a world where religion materialized in the form of a God made of flesh. Follow the chosen <strong>saint</strong>  in his journey through the <strong>Communion</strong>, the mysterious process of God's replacement.\u00a0 <br><br><i><strong>Whose will is God's will?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884550/extras/3f8b485a0bfdd63d3818bf608404e938.avif?t=1756147854\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Re-Imagined turn based combats:</strong> With a set turn order and regenerating mana every two turns, combat becomes a game of tempo control where every decision matters. Overwhelm enemies with a flurry of strikes to trigger <strong><i>SPIRIT BREAK</i></strong>, a mechanic that weakens their next attack!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884550/extras/3a27254baa985821637c8679f8e181a3.poster.avif?t=1756147854\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884550/extras/3a27254baa985821637c8679f8e181a3.webm?t=1756147854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884550/extras/3a27254baa985821637c8679f8e181a3.mp4?t=1756147854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strengthen your will:</strong>\u00a0Enemies will drop ingredients once defeated. Rest by the fire to cook and improve your stats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884550/extras/d95453c68b455e5817bca398c8a4ef3f.poster.avif?t=1756147854\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884550/extras/d95453c68b455e5817bca398c8a4ef3f.webm?t=1756147854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884550/extras/d95453c68b455e5817bca398c8a4ef3f.mp4?t=1756147854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memories  by the fire:</strong> At the fire, dive into your memories and reclaim the power buried in them. Learn and upgrade each character's skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884550/extras/f1d2ef2b1f6fd66833c783